\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The core stack: MCP, A2A, AG-UI.
\f1\b0 \'a0Why these three are converging into the universal foundation, what each one is really for, and where each one fails if treated as a feature toggle instead of a boundary.\cb1 \
